# "This land enters tapped unless you control an Island or a Swamp" (CR 614.12): Bot1 plays a Swamp on turn 1 and Kishla Village
# on turn 3, so the Village enters untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Kishla Village
Island x25

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Kishla Village.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Kishla Village.Tapped = false

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Kishla Village.Tapped = false
